{"page":"SMIM26","gene":"SMIM26","accession":"A0A096LP01","protein":"Small integral membrane protein 26","length":95,"events":["Alternative splicing"],"canonical":{"accession":"A0A096LP01-1","name":"1","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000411646.2"],"refseq":["NM_001348957.2"],"refseqProteins":["NP_001335886.1"],"maneSelect":true,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"model":{"entry":"AF-A0A096LP01-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-A0A096LP01-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":71.7,"plddt":[[50,3],[70,9],[90,17],[70,6],[50,9],[0,7],[50,11],[70,8],[50,5],[70,13],[50,5],[0,2]]}},"features":[{"type":"Topological domain","start":1,"end":12,"description":"Cytoplasmic"},{"type":"Transmembrane","start":13,"end":35,"description":"Helical"},{"type":"Region","start":13,"end":44,"description":"Required for interaction with SFXN1"},{"type":"Topological domain","start":36,"end":95,"description":"Mitochondrial intermembrane"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":46,"end":46,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":48,"end":48,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":52,"end":52,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Region","start":61,"end":76,"description":"Required for interaction with the mitochondrial ribosomal large subunit"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Forms homodimers or higher order multimers (PubMed:41991342). Interacts with voltage-gated ion channel VDAC1 in the outer mitochondrial membrane and with ADP:ATP antiporter SLC25A6 in the inner mitochondrial membrane; the interactions connect these two metabolite transporters and ensure respiratory chain function (PubMed:41991342). Interacts with the mitochondrial ribosomal large subunit and with mitochondrial serine transporters SFXN1, SFXN2 AND SFXN3; interaction with SFXN3 is weaker than with SFXN1 or SFXN2; interaction with SFXN1 is required for SMIM26 stability (PubMed:40578345). Interacts with AGK and SLC25A11"}],"isoform